  "sections": {
    "review": {
      "summary": "Audited every action item of the owner's DvP specification v1.1 (sections 4-12) against the repository: test IDs T01-T40 by test function, experiment registry statuses, section 11 deliverables, CLI contracts, the frozen manifest. Found open: Phase 5 (C00-C05) PLANNED though D/ST was PROMISING (the section 5 gate is a credible group-level signal, not prospective confirmation); T26 and T27 had no tests; no verify-only mode; METRICS.csv, calibration and error-by-season plots and the section 11 per-position conclusions table missing; the project next action was stale (weather PR from 2026-11-22). Reproduction rerun on scratch copies: the 2025 holdout from the frozen commit 165d140 and development/validation from main give identical forecast content and results; found R-075 (a development rerun rewrote frozen-candidates metadata; forecast bytes are row-order dependent). Arbit has no player projection (the app says projections are not built) and FFA lineups exist only for 2026 periods 1-10 (read-only query).",
      "files": [
        "config/dvp/sitstart.json"
      ]
    },
    "plan": {
      "summary": "1) Declare Phase C first (config/dvp/sitstart.json): D/ST only by the gate; C00 = B00; pairwise start/sit accuracy of the frozen b06 vs b00 on every same-week pair; ties; close and waiver-pool subgroups; week-block bootstrap 2,000/1729; practical minimum 1.8 points derived from Phase B's 1% RMSE minimum and B00's development Spearman; rule PROMISING/INCONCLUSIVE/NOT_USEFUL/BLOCKED; commit and push before computing. 2) decisions.py (pure) and dvp.py sitstart on hash-checked frozen forecasts. 3) dvp.py verify (verify-only, T27). 4) Idempotent reruns (R-075). 5) T26/T27 tests and the T31 scan list. 6) Freeze Phase C for 2026 weeks 12-18 before 2026-11-26 01:00 UTC. 7) report: METRICS.csv, calibration, error-by-season, sitstart plots; registry. 8) Documents and records.",
      "files": [
        "config/dvp/sitstart.json"
      ]
    },
    "implementation": {
      "summary": "decisions.py: units (D/ST forecast row -> the scoring D/ST, orientation checked against canonical observations, fails closed), pairs, metrics (accuracy, changed choices, points from changes, worst cases, within-week Spearman, top 8, subgroups, week-block bootstrap), decide. dvp.py: sitstart (checks frozen candidates and audit run, forecast hashes, projection-like columns, common rows); verify (v0 bytes, frozen commit vs manifest via git show, working-tree changes, audit outputs, every metric recomputed, label joins, D/ST whole points, relative bias, sign, sample, receipts verified); write_forecasts and content_sha256 (write once, refuse different content); development never rewrites frozen-candidates.json; report adds METRICS.csv and three plots; registry adds C00-C05 records; SCANNED adds decisions.py. config/dvp/frozen-phase-c.json frozen 2026-11-24T06:57:55Z. Results: Phase C PROMISING (+4.45/+8.55/+6.62 points); verify PASSED (468 metrics).",
